Imports:
  - Types:
      - Provider
    From: sententia/llm/provider

Usages:
  conventions: .goga/usages/conventions.md
  anthropic_api: .goga/usages/cooks/anthropic_api.md

Annotations: |
  Apply `conventions` for code and test standards.

  Anthropic Claude LLM provider.
  Follow `anthropic_api` for Anthropic API integration.

---

"Provider::AnthropicProvider(url: str, model: str, token: str | None = None)":
  location: provider.py
  annotations: |
    Anthropic Claude LLM provider implementation.

    `url`: base URL of the API endpoint.
    `model`: model identifier string.
    `token`: API key for Anthropic authentication. This parameter is required and must not be None.
  methods:
    "generate(prompt: str) -> answer:str": |
      Generate text via the Anthropic Messages API (POST {url}/v1/messages).

      `prompt`: complete prompt text.
      `answer`: generated response text.

      Implement using the `anthropic_api` practice.

